protected_assets:
  - copyright_id: "example-01"
    software_name: 示例系统
    status: submitted
    immutable: true
    path: /absolute/path/to/submitted-materials/example-01
    digest_algorithm: openssl-directory-v1
    expected_digest: replace-with-computed-directory-digest
    policy: 已提交材料只允许只读审计，禁止重新生成或覆盖
